@startuml
title ATM Control - Combined Scenarios

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state "Waiting for Card Insertion" as WaitingForCardInsertion
state "Waiting for PIN" as WaitingForPIN
state "Validating PIN" as ValidatingPIN
state "Waiting for Customer Choice" as WaitingForChoice
state Confiscating
state Ejecting
state ProcessingTransaction
state PrintingReceipt
state DispensingCash
state CancellingOperation
state ShortEndingPhase
state ClosedDown

Idle --> WaitingForCardInsertion : Card Inserted / Get PIN
WaitingForCardInsertion --> WaitingForPIN

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt

ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForChoice : Correct PIN / Display Options
WaitingForChoice --> ProcessingTransaction : User Choice / Process Request
ProcessingTransaction --> PrintingReceipt : Approved Transaction / Print Receipt
ProcessingTransaction --> DispensingCash : Approved Transaction / Dispense Cash
ProcessingTransaction --> CancellingOperation : Rejected Request / Cancel Operation
ProcessingTransaction --> ShortEndingPhase : Completed Transaction / Short Ending Phase
ShortEndingPhase --> Idle : Normal Condition / Reset to Wait
ShortEndingPhase --> ClosedDown : System Down / Display System Down
CancellingOperation --> Ejecting : User Cancelled / Return Card
CancellingOperation --> ShortEndingPhase : Cancellation Process / Short Ending Phase
@enduml
